.         gen d_daughter = 0 if pld0026 == -2
(28,113 missing values generated)

.         replace d_daughter = 1 if pld0026 == 1 | pld0026 == 2 | pld0026 == 3 
> | pld0026 == 4 | pld0026 == 6 | pld0026 == 9
(2,435 real changes made)

